# ─── Generated puzzle exports ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The picture corpora are committed INPUTS: pictures/ is a test fixture the
# FR-022 acceptance criteria measure against, silhouette/ is the source library.
# The puzzles generated FROM them are regenerable output — the exporter writes
# <name>-<difficulty>.pdf next to its own source, so they accumulate in these
# directories on every run.
pictures/**/*.pdf
pictures/**/*.svg
pictures/**/*.json
pictures/**/*.csv
silhouette/**/*.pdf
silhouette/**/*.svg
silhouette/**/*.json
silhouette/**/*.csv

# macOS Finder metadata (four were sitting untracked in silhouette/).
.DS_Store
